{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aef9f482b7e2fd01", "type": "tool_result", "content": "=== PAGE 21 ===\nalone is highly ambiguous when the candidate pool contains semantically or phonetically\nsimilar distractors. (ii) LaBraM-MSE (embedding-only matching) occasionally ranks the\nground truth near the top (e.g. RA cases 1 and 4 at rank 2) but is unreliable overall (median\n∼23 on RA, ∼79 on PL). (iii) EEGAlign’s fused score successfully combines both evidence\nchannels: even when one component fails catastrophically (CTC rank >80 or embedding\nrank >80), the other component compensates, yielding rank 1 in all 10 displayed cases. This\ncase-level analysis is consistent with the aggregate fusion gain reported in Section 4.7 and\nsupports the view that the text and CTC branches provide complementary, not redundant,\nevidence.\n21\nShell cwd was reset to /inspire/qb-ilm/project/video-generation/chenxie-25019/hyr/iHateTheWorld555.github.io", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "e3cc4b93-fc68-46ce-b710-420272e6b32a", "uuid": "d6a56b06-f74d-4864-a3f7-085f7d2ffdda", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T08:26:38.705Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "=== PAGE 21 ===\nalone is highly ambiguous when the candidate pool contains semantically or phonetically\nsimilar distractors. (ii) LaBraM-MSE (embedding-only matching) occasionally ranks the\nground truth near the top (e.g. RA cases 1 and 4 at rank 2) but is unreliable overall (median\n∼23 on RA, ∼79 on PL). (iii) EEGAlign’s fused score successfully combines both evidence\nchannels: even when one component fails catastrophically (CTC rank >80 or embedding\nrank >80), the other component compensates, yielding rank 1 in all 10 displayed cases. This\ncase-level analysis is consistent with the aggregate fusion gain reported in Section 4.7 and\nsupports the view that the text and CTC branches provide complementary, not redundant,\nevidence.\n21", "stderr": "\nShell